&lt;li&gt;Experience (typically 3+ years) in commercial analytics, trading analytics or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work independently&lt;/li&gt;
