&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum&#39;s mission is to build the first useful quantum computers: machines capable of delivering the breakthroughs the field has long promised. Since our founding in 2016, our singular focus has been to build and deploy million-qubit, fault-tolerant quantum systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Quantum computers harness the laws of quantum mechanics to solve problems that even the most advanced supercomputers or AI systems will never reach. Their impact will span energy, pharmaceuticals, finance, agriculture, transportation, materials, and other foundational industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our architecture&amp;nbsp;and approach&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;based on silicon photonics. By&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;the advanced semiconductor manufacturing industry, including partners like GlobalFoundries, we use the same high-volume processes that already produce billions of chips for telecom and consumer electronics. Photonics offers natural advantages for scale: photons&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;feel heat, are immune to electromagnetic interference, and integrate with existing cryogenic cooling and standard fiber-optic infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;That approach has since been tested at the highest level of scrutiny the U.S. government applies to emerging technology, and it has held up. In 2025,&amp;nbsp;PsiQuantum&amp;nbsp;closed a&amp;nbsp;$1 billion&amp;nbsp;funding round that valued the company at&amp;nbsp;$7 billion. In 2026, the U.S. Department of Commerce signed a $100 million Letter of Intent under the CHIPS and Science Act, followed by a $125 million agreement with DARPA under Stage C of its Quantum Benchmarking Initiative,&amp;nbsp;PsiQuantum&#39;s&amp;nbsp;most valuable U.S. government agreement to date. This year, we also broke ground on our utility-scale quantum computer in Brisbane, Australia, and continued building out our Chicago site. Victor Peng, our CEO, and co-founder Jeremy O&#39;Brien, now Executive&amp;nbsp;Chairman, lead a team and board that reflects how seriously the world is taking this build, joined this year by Intel&#39;s Lip-Bu Tan and Atomico&#39;s Niklas&amp;nbsp;Zennström.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum&amp;nbsp;also develops the algorithms and software needed to make these systems commercially valuable. Our application, software, and industry teams work directly with leading Fortune 500 companies, including&amp;nbsp;Airbus,&amp;nbsp;Lockheed&amp;nbsp;Martin, Mercedes-Benz, Boehringer Ingelheim, and Mitsubishi Chemical, to prepare quantum solutions for real-world impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Quantum computing is not an extension of classical computing. It&amp;nbsp;represents&amp;nbsp;a fundamental shift, and a path to mastering challenges that cannot be&amp;nbsp;solved&amp;nbsp;any other way. The potential is enormous, and we now have&amp;nbsp;the funding,&amp;nbsp;the government&amp;nbsp;validation, and&amp;nbsp;the sites&amp;nbsp;under construction to make it real.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Within the Quantum Algorithms team, we develop and adapt quantum algorithms, identify and scope promising use cases, and analyze their resource requirements. In this role, you will translate computational tasks into abstract quantum-algorithm specifications, analyze their asymptotic performance, and define meaningful problem instances that lie beyond the practical reach of classical computation. You will also work closely with PsiQuantum’s Compilation team to develop explicit implementations of these algorithms and evaluate their resource requirements on our architecture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;582&quot;&gt;In this position, you will be expected not only to conduct outstanding individual research, but also to formulate and lead broader research programs that draw on the work of other researchers and collaborators. You will contribute to cross-team initiatives spanning PsiQuantum’s applications, architecture, and compilation efforts, helping to connect algorithm design with the practical requirements of fault-tolerant quantum computation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1023&quot;&gt;The role will also involve external collaboration. You will have the opportunity to lead projects with industrial and research partners, working with domain experts to identify important computational challenges, formulate them as well-defined problems, and map them to appropriate quantum algorithms. Success in this work requires the ability to communicate across disciplinary boundaries and to move fluently between real-world applications, mathematical abstractions, algorithmic complexity, and implementation-level resource analysis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1564&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines deep technical expertise with scientific leadership, intellectual independence, and a collaborative mindset. They will be comfortable shaping open-ended research directions, assessing the practical significance of algorithmic advances, and guiding projects from the initial identification of an application through to a concrete fault-tolerant quantum algorithm and a detailed resource estimate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Propose initiatives into research and development of quantum algorithms tailored for fault-tolerant quantum computers; act as primary contributor to research programs beyond the current state of the art in quantum algorithms design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Work closely with external partners to instantiate, validate and optimize quantum algorithms for use cases across a variety of domains, such as life sciences, industry and sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Establish families of benchmarks and problem instances to validate post-classicality of quantum algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Guide both the simulation and analysis of resource requirements for fault tolerant implementation of quantum algorithms in photonic quantum computing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience/Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;5+ years of research experience (academia or industry) in the field of quantum computing, with focus on algorithms and applications.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;A degree in Physics, Math or Computer Science or equivalent is required. PhD in Physics, Math or Computer Science, with a focus on quantum information theory or quantum computation will be preferred. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience with quantum algorithms and compiling in the regime of fault tolerant gates preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience working with partners in academia or industry to analyze real-world quantum applications of interest preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Proven team player with an ability to work effectively across departments, sites and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently and contribute to fast-moving start-up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience programming in Python, C++ or similar languages.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PsiQuantum provides equal employment opportunity for all applicants and employees. PsiQuantum does not unlawfully discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), gender identity, gender expression, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, physical or mental disability, military or veteran status, marital status, domestic partner status, sexual orientation, genetic information, or any other basis protected by applicable laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Note: PsiQuantum will only reach out to you using an official PsiQuantum email address and will never ask you for bank account information as part of the interview process. Please report any suspicious activity to &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are not accepting unsolicited resumes from employment agencies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ranges below reflect the target ranges for a new hire base salary.&amp;nbsp;Actual compensation may vary outside of these ranges and is dependent on various factors including but not limited to a candidate&#39;s qualifications including relevant education and training, competencies, experience, geographic location, and business needs. Base pay is only one part of the total compensation package. Full time roles are eligible for equity and benefits. Base pay is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Daresbury, United Kingdom &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£78,900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£92,900 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #00358e; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Baringa is looking for talented 2027 Summer Interns to join our Government &amp;amp; Public Sector team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Internship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our internship programmes will give you a first-hand view of life in an award-winning management consultancy firm. You will gain an understanding of the consulting business model as well as hands-on experience across the consulting project lifecycle, from understanding client challenges and analysing evidence through to developing recommendations and supporting delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern you will join a real team, working and learning from experienced consultants, with exposure to meaningful client work alongside a structured programme to learn more about Baringa and working as a consultant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #00358e;&quot;&gt;About the Government team at Baringa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Government team helps departments, agencies and public services solve complex problems and deliver better outcomes for citizens. Our work spans Central Government, Home Affairs, and Health and Public Infrastructure, from redesigning services and strengthening operations to using data, technology and AI to improve decisions and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work on Government’s most complex changes, partnering with departments across Whitehall and the wider public sector, using our skills in Strategy and Business Cases, Project Delivery, Operational Delivery, DDaT and Government Commercial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UK public sector is navigating significant challenges and opportunities, including the delivery of major national priorities and missions. As our Public Sector team continues to grow, we are looking for curious and motivated interns who are excited to learn, contribute and develop with us. You do not need previous consulting or public sector experience – we are interested in how you approach problems, learn new things and apply your skills to real-world challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #00358e;&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will embed you in a project for your internship period, working alongside a team of experienced consultants to learn whilst delivering real client outcomes. You will not be expected to know how to do all of this from day one. You will be supported throughout and given opportunities to build your skills through meaningful project work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the project you join, you may have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse quantitative and qualitative information to identify insights, trends and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore how data, digital technology, automation or AI could help improve public services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop recommendations and delivery plans, considering how people, technology and data work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of client materials, including presentations, reports, workshop outputs and project updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to meetings and workshop discussions, helping to capture key points, actions and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn how consulting teams work together to solve problems, structure ambiguous challenges and communicate clearly with clients and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of the type of projects you could be working on are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support transformation projects that help government and public sector organisations improve services, strengthen operations and deliver better outcomes for citizens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help review how services and processes work, from frontline delivery through to internal operations, identifying opportunities to make them simpler, more effective or more resilient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to digital, data and analytics work, including projects that use AI or data-led approaches to help clients make better decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of business cases and funding proposals, helping clients assess different options and make evidence-based decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design how services should operate, looking at how people, processes, technology and data come together to deliver better results within operating models and service blueprints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support commercial and procurement activity, such as researching suppliers, comparing options and helping prepare materials for decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #00358e;&quot;&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from students across a broad range of academic disciplines, including STEM and non-STEM subjects, and are particularly keen to hear from students who enjoy solving complex problems using evidence, data, technology and creative thinking. You do not need to have previous experience in consulting or the public sector - what matters most is your curiosity, willingness to learn and interest in helping public sector organisations solve complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for people who are excited by the opportunity to learn how consulting teams work, contribute to meaningful client projects and develop their skills in a supportive environment. You may be a good fit if you bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured problem solving&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to break down unfamiliar questions and identify what matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data analysis skills&lt;/strong&gt;, and comfort working with data to surface insight and support evidence-based recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital and AI literacy&lt;/strong&gt;, with genuine curiosity about AI and its practical application, and a foundational understanding of how to use these tools responsibly and ethically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interest in policy, government and public service&lt;/strong&gt;, and how national priorities translate into delivery on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and financial curiosity&lt;/strong&gt;, with an interest in how money, value and delivery decisions shape public services, and comfort working with numbers to support them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, including the ability to explain ideas simply and structure your thinking in writing and conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A collaborative approach&lt;/strong&gt;, with enthusiasm for working in teams and learning from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Willingness to learn and adapt&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly in a fast-paced project environment where priorities can evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to detail and ownership&lt;/strong&gt;, taking pride in the quality of your work and following through on tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A proactive attitude&lt;/strong&gt;, with the confidence to ask questions, contribute ideas and get involved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We do not expect you to have all the answers from day one. We are looking for potential, enthusiasm and a genuine interest in developing your consulting skills while contributing to work that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #00358e;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An internship at Baringa is what you make it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an 8-week paid internship where you get real project experience alongside structured coaching and training with an opportunity to build your analytical, communication and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will leave the internship with practical consulting experience, a stronger understanding of public sector work, and a clearer view of whether consulting is the right career path for you. High performing interns may also be considered for a permanent role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #00358e;&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants should be in their penultimate year of their bachelor’s or master’s Degree studies. Applicants must have the permanent right to work in the UK now and in the future and be eligible for a UK Security Check (SC) clearance. All applicants will be asked for proof if invited to an assessment centre.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note we’re unable to sponsor individuals for this opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #00358e;&quot;&gt;Key dates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Application window closes: Monday 28&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; September 2026 at&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;12:00pm GMT&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;Assessment centres: w/c 30&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; November / 7&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; December&lt;br&gt;Internship start: Monday 5&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; July 2027&lt;br&gt;Internship end: Friday 27&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; August 2027&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a paid full-time internship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For further information, please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/graduate/pdfs-and-downloads/global-summer-internship-pack-2026.pdf&quot;&gt;Summer Internship 2027 pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We believe that creating an environment where everyone feels a sense of belonging is central to our culture and that diversity is paramount to driving creativity, innovation, and value for our clients and for our people.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;An award-winning workplace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You can be a part of our ‘Great Place to Work’ – with our commitment to women and well-being in the workplace for all. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/en/impact/awards/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; to see some of our recent awards and how we’ve achieved this.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Using business as a force for good.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We maintain high standards of environmental performance and transparency, which can be seen through our commitment to Net Zero with our SBTI-verified Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions reduction targets and our support of the Better Business Act. We report our progress publicly and ensure that we are also externally assessed and scored through organisations like CDP and EcoVadis - helping us to continually identify where we can improve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have a long legacy of supporting the communities in which we work, and offer a variety of ways to contribute, by putting people first and creating impact that lasts. Our Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) agenda is about giving back to the communities in which we live and work by sharing our skills, talent and time. In essence, we aim to empower and encourage everyone in the firm to contribute to the things we care about, and support registered charities and organisations with a clear social or environmental purpose to increase the positive impact they can have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Join us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All applications received will be reviewed by a member of our Talent Acquisition team. We never rely solely on automated screening or AI tools to make hiring decisions. Your application will be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, nationality, disability, age, faith or social background. We do not filter applications by university background and encourage those who have taken alternative educational and career paths to apply. We would like to actively encourage applications from those who identify with less represented and minority groups. We operate an inclusive recruitment process, ensuring reasonable adjustments where needed. Please contact a member of our Recruitment Team to discuss further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Baringa Privacy Notices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For UK &amp;amp; EU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-004-ukrpn---uk-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;UK Recruitment Privacy Notice / &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-005-eurpn---eu-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;EU Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, to evaluate your application and meet our legal and reporting obligations. In line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to request access to, rectification, or erasure (subject to legal limitations) of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the USA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data may be retained by Baringa for up to two years, as outlined in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to support the recruitment process and internal reporting requirements. Where applicable, and in accordance with relevant federal and state laws, you may have the right to request access to or correction of your personal information. For further details, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Australia &amp;amp; Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Clients and Marketing team are looking for an experienced Marketing Business Partner to join them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Over the past nine months, Clients &amp;amp; Marketing has evolved from a purist marketing function into a broadened, end-to-end Clients &amp;amp; Marketing team.  Our focus now spans from brand and market positioning through to deeper client relationships, improved win rates, revenue growth, and increased net margin. This is being underpinned by an operational transformation including&amp;nbsp;cNPS, new ways of working, and a content management platform driving greater efficiency and effectiveness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;now looking for the marketing and business development professionals that can guide us through this exciting transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with the Clients &amp;amp; Marketing Exec Sponsor and sector leadership teams to shape and deliver strategic marketing plans that advance sector priorities and drive measurable commercial impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the end‑to‑end delivery of campaign and event programmes, ensuring high‑quality execution and measurable commercial impact.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building a strong understanding of client challenges, market trends, competitor activity, and Baringa’s sector capabilities to refine messaging, targeting, and segmentation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the in‑sector marketing team (where applicable), providing coaching, development, and day‑to‑day support.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing consistency, collaboration, and efficiency across sectors by working closely with fellow BPs and the wider Clients &amp;amp; Marketing team.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the creation of compelling messaging and visuals that clearly differentiate Baringa in the market. Leveraging thought leadership, client success stories, and insight‑driven narratives to deliver standout campaigns and assets.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the sector marketing budget, ensuring responsible management, cost control, and ongoing value‑for‑money improvements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing the sector strategy to life across the business—building alignment, energy, and advocacy for campaign activity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;in shaping marketing strategy and the&amp;nbsp;appropriate selection&amp;nbsp;of tactics to drive a business forward and increase customer engagement and sales; use of the full multichannel mix.&amp;nbsp; Strategic marketing experience in a B2B environment.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in professional services marketing, with a focus on Public Sector/Government clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert relationship building and network creation – internally and with external parties.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Ability to work across all levels with impact,&amp;nbsp;effectiveness&amp;nbsp;and influence.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in Business Development, Account Growth and relationship management will be advantageous&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in pre-empting,&amp;nbsp;identifying,&amp;nbsp;resolving&amp;nbsp;and escalating issues.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Self-sufficient, self-starter.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally educated to Degree level or equivalent. Ideally CIM Diploma-qualified or equivalent.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
