&lt;h2&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The DAP Repository Flows team owns two areas within GitLab&#39;s Duo Agent Platform (DAP). The first is &lt;strong&gt;DAP onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;, helping customers quickly set up a project so they can start using the Duo Agent Platform with minimal friction. The second is &lt;strong&gt;repository and background flows&lt;/strong&gt;: autonomous and scheduled agents that work on a customer&#39;s codebase on their behalf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This work is central to how GitLab delivers AI-powered automation on repositories. As a Senior Software Engineer, you will own features end to end, from design through delivery, building agentic experiences on top of the Duo Agent Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do in this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design and delivery of features end to end across DAP onboarding and repository/background flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build autonomous and scheduled agents that operate on customer codebases, building on top of the Duo Agent Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the DAP onboarding experience so customers can get a project configured and productive quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers across the DAP organization on shared interfaces and patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review designs and code, and contribute to the team&#39;s technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of autonomy, ownership, high context sharing, and async-first collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Ruby and Ruby on Rails&lt;/strong&gt; in production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating &lt;strong&gt;LLMs into products&lt;/strong&gt; (product integration, not ML model training).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building &lt;strong&gt;agentic systems&lt;/strong&gt;: autonomous or semi-autonomous agents that take actions on a user&#39;s behalf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing and shipping features independently in a collaborative team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication and the ability to operate effectively in a distributed, async-first environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The DAP Repository Flows team is part of GitLab&#39;s broader Duo Agent Platform organization, within the AI/R&amp;amp;D group. The team is small and distributed, with plans to grow. We value autonomy, ownership, and high context sharing, and we work async-first through GitLab issues and Slack.&lt;/p&gt;
